​II. The Core Mechanics: The Field and the Trigger
​To execute the protocol, the operator must first understand the physics of the environment.
​The Conglomerate: The aggregate of societal structures, synchronized historical memory, and unconscious human networks. It is a high-entropy field. The Conglomerate operates by attempting to "write" its outdated, decaying data into your system.
